'''Typhoon Nihil''' (絶・台風零号, ''Zetsu・Ze Taifū Reigō'', '''Absolute・Typhoon Zero''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]] and appears every Saturday. It is unlocked after clearing [[Charybdis' Mouth (Merciless)|Typhoon Nemo]]. The first stage yields 1,000,000 XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Primordial Cat]] - Future Cat.

